arketing strategy from it, plans the month, drafts posts, carousels and reels, tracks competitors, runs campaigns and creator collaborations, and handles the social inbox.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Pulsar\",\"price\":\"15000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Pulsar\",\"description\":\"Answers enquiries on WhatsApp, email and SMS within minutes, qualifies budget, timeline and fit, scores every lead, and runs broadcasts, automation and voice calling.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Both agents\",\"price\":\"20000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Both agents\",\"description\":\"Gravity and Pulsar on one account, sharing the same brand memory.\"}}]}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"bg-ground text-ink font-body antialiased\"><nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 border-b border-rule transition-all duration-300 bg-ground/80 backdrop-blur-sm\" style=\"transform:translateY(-64px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between py-7 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><a class=\"flex-shrink-0\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Nebulaa.ai\" fetchPriority=\"high\" loading=\"eager\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-10 w-auto hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity dark:hidden\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75\"/><img alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fetchPriority=\"high\" loading=\"eager\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-10 w-auto hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity brightness-110 hidden dark:block\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75\"/></a><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-[38px]\"><div class=\"relative\"><button class=\"flex items-center gap-1 font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Product<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><a class=\"relative font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors group\" href=\"/channels\">Channels<span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-px bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span></a><a class=\"relative font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors group\" href=\"/services\">Services<span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-px bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span></a><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"relative font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors group\">Pricing<span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-px bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span></a><div class=\"relative\"><button class=\"flex items-center gap-1 font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Resources<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-3.5\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Sign in</a><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"font-body text-sm font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black rounded-full px-[22px] py-[11px] shadow-[0_4px_18px_rgba(245,166,35,0.20)] hover:bg-brand-gold-dim transition-all\">Start free</a></div><div class=\"md:hidden flex items-center gap-2\"><button class=\"text-ink\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></nav><main class=\"bg-ground text-ink min-h-screen\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"By industry\",\"item\":\"https://nebulaa.ai/for\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Textile & Apparel\",\"item\":\"https://nebulaa.ai/for/textile-apparel\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Marketing for Textile & Apparel\",\"description\":\"Multi-branch content and WhatsApp follow-up for textile and apparel retailers — trusted by JKR Tex.\",\"serviceType\":\"Marketing service\",\"url\":\"https://nebulaa.ai/for/textile-apparel\",\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Nebulaa\",\"url\":\"https://nebulaa.ai\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"India\"}}</script><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] pt-[140px] pb-[90px] max-w-[900px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[26px] block\">For textile &amp; apparel</span><h1 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[38px] md:text-[60px] leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-[28px]\" style=\"text-wrap:pretty\">Six branches, one voice,<br/><span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">every single day.</span></h1><p class=\"text-[17px] leading-[1.65] text-muted max-w-[620px] mb-9\">A multi-branch textile business can&#x27;t run content the way a single shop does — every branch, every collection, every regional festival. Gravity plans the month once and adapts it; Pulsar catches every enquiry across every location.</p><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"inline-block bg-gold text-[#1A1208] text-[15px] font-semibold px-[28px] py-[14px] rounded-full shadow-[0_6px_26px_rgba(245,166,35,0.24)] hover:brightness-105 transition\">Start free trial →</a></section><div class=\"border-y border-rule py-10 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] flex items-center gap-11 flex-wrap\"><span class=\"neb-label  flex-shrink-0\">Working with</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-9 flex-wrap\"><span class=\"font-heading text-lg text-ink-2\">JKR Tex</span></div></div><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px]\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[28px] md:text-4xl mb-8\">Sound familiar?</h2><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3.5\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 bg-surface border border-rule rounded-xl p-[18px]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x text-red-400/70 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">Content that works for one branch doesn&#x27;t always translate to the next region</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 bg-surface border border-rule rounded-xl p-[18px]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x text-red-400/70 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">New stock arrives faster than anyone has time to photograph and post it</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 bg-surface border border-rule rounded-xl p-[18px]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x text-red-400/70 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">Regional festivals and local buying seasons need their own content calendar, not a generic one</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 bg-surface border border-rule rounded-xl p-[18px]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x text-red-400/70 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">A missed WhatsApp enquiry at one branch is a lost sale that never gets tracked</p></div></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px]\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[28px] md:text-4xl mb-8\">How Nebulaa helps <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">textile &amp; apparel</span></h2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-2xl p-6 flex items-start gap-5\"><span class=\"inline-block font-body text-[11px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5 bg-gold/15 text-gold-text\">Gravity</span><div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-lg mb-1.5\">Multi-branch content, one system</h3><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Gravity plans the month&#x27;s content once and localises it — the same quality bar across every branch, without a separate content person per location.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-2xl p-6 flex items-start gap-5\"><span class=\"inline-block font-body text-[11px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5 bg-gold/15 text-gold-text\">Gravity</span><div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-lg mb-1.5\">Regional festival planning</h3><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Festival and season content is mapped in advance, so no branch goes quiet during the buying window that matters most to it.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-2xl p-6 flex items-start gap-5\"><span class=\"inline-block font-body text-[11px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5 bg-orange-400/15 text-orange-400\">Pulsar</span><div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-lg mb-1.5\">Enquiry follow-up, every branch</h3><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Pulsar answers WhatsApp enquiries the same day regardless of which branch they come through, and hands over anyone ready to buy.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-2xl p-6 flex items-start gap-5\"><span class=\"inline-block font-body text-[11px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5 bg-gold/15 text-gold-text\">Gravity</span><div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-lg mb-1.5\">Competitor tracking</h3><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Gravity watches what other textile retailers in the region are running and keeps your content a step ahead, not a step behind.</p></div></div></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px]\"><div class=\"max-w-[640px] mb-9\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[18px] block\">What the output looks like</span><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[28px] md:text-4xl mb-3.5\">The kind of post Gravity writes <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">for this sector.</span></h2><p class=\"text-[15px] leading-[1.65] text-muted\">Illustrative of the format and tone — not a client&#x27;s published campaign.</p></div><div class=\"max-w-[420px]\"><div class=\"relative rounded-[14px] border border-dashed border-rule-2 bg-surface-2/60 flex items-center justify-center p-6 \" style=\"aspect-ratio:1 / 1\" data-media-slot=\"creative-textile\"><div class=\"max-w-[46ch] text-center\"><p class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-2.5\">creative<!-- --> · awaiting asset</p><p class=\"font-heading text-[17px] text-ink mb-2\">Sample creative — textile</p><p class=\"font-body text-[13px] leading-[1.55] text-muted mb-3\">A social post in the style Gravity produces for a textile retailer.</p><p class=\"font-body text-[11.5px] text-faint\">Drop <code class=\"text-ink-2\">creative-textile.jpg</code> into <code class=\"text-ink-2\">public/media/</code> · <!-- -->1080×1080</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"relative px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[130px] pb-[140px] text-center border-t border-rule overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(50% 70% at 50% 100%, rgba(245,166,35,0.10) 0%, rgba(245,166,35,0) 62%)\"></div><div class=\"relative\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[32px] md:text-[50px] leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-6\">Built for <!-- -->textile &amp; apparel<!-- -->.<br/><span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">Ready in a minute.</span></h2><p class=\"text-[16px] leading-[1.65] text-muted max-w-[480px] mx-auto mb-9\">Give Nebulaa your website URL. It learns your brand and starts building the content queue — no brief, no onboarding call.</p><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"inline-block bg-gold text-[#1A1208] text-[15px] font-semibold px-[30px] py-[15px] rounded-full